 * Prince Edward Islands at 46 degrees south, which project 200px below the
 * box; a shape outside the frame is not drawn. Generated once and stored as static paths, so no page
 * depends on a runtime fetch and every render is identical.
 *
 * Transcribed from .design/screens/assets/sadc-geometry.js. Do not hand-edit
 * the path data.
 */

